# Tuvok, Chief Tactical Officer reselects what one member of an attacking band attacks: all creatures in an attacking band
# attack the same player, planeswalker or battle (CR 702.22d), so the band moves as one. Bot1's Benalish Hero and Memnite
# attack Bot2 as a band (CR 702.22c); Bot1 flashes Tuvok in during the declare attackers step, targets only the Memnite and
# reselects Bot2's Liliana of the Veil. Both band members now attack Liliana: Bot2 takes nothing and Liliana's 3 loyalty
# drops by the 2 damage, where the Hero left attacking Bot2 would have dealt Bot2 1 and Liliana only 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Benalish Hero
Memnite
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Tuvok, Chief Tactical Officer
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Liliana of the Veil
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Liliana of the Veil.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Benalish Hero > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tuvok, Chief Tactical Officer.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Blockers]
? Combat.Attackers = Benalish Hero > Liliana of the Veil (band 1); Memnite > Liliana of the Veil (band 1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Stack.Count = 0
